  "notes": [
    "-AR verb with orthographic spelling change: c→qu before *e* (provoqué, provoque, provoquemos, provoquen)",
    "Past participle: *provocado*",
    "*provocar algo* = to cause/trigger something (*El estrés provoca insomnio* — Stress causes insomnia)",
    "*provocar a alguien* = to provoke someone (*No le provoques* — Don't provoke him)",
    "Related: *la provocación* = provocation; *provocador/a* = provocative"
  ],
